# ===== Descriptions (hover hint) =====
desc_char_select => Pick which character file to edit. The list is built from data/characterList.txt plus every characters/*.json found in loaded mods. / 选择要编辑的角色文件。列表来自 data/characterList.txt 以及已加载模组中的所有 characters/*.json。
desc_image => The image/sprite sheet file used by this character (e.g. characters/BOYFRIEND). Reload Image re-reads it from disk. / 该角色使用的图像/精灵表文件（例如 characters/BOYFRIEND）。重新加载图像会从磁盘重新读取。
desc_reload_image => Re-read the current image file from disk and rebuild all animations. Useful after editing the sprite sheet outside the editor. / 从磁盘重新读取当前图像文件并重建所有动画。在编辑器外修改过精灵表后使用。
desc_health_icon => The health icon shown on the health bar in gameplay (e.g. bf, dad, gf). / 游戏内血条上显示的血条图标（例如 bf、dad、gf）。
desc_get_icon_color => Sample the dominant color of the health icon and write it into the health bar RGB values. / 提取血条图标的主色，并写入血条 RGB 值。
desc_vocals => Optional postfix for the character's vocal track file. Leave empty to use the default vocal file. / 角色人声轨文件的可选后缀。留空则使用默认人声文件。
desc_anim_select => Pick an animation to edit its name, symbol/tag, framerate, loop flag and offsets. / 选择要编辑的动画，可修改其名称、符号/标签、帧率、循环标志和偏移。
desc_anim_name => The animation name that appears in gameplay logic (e.g. singLEFT). Must match what the game requests. / 游戏逻辑中使用的动画名称（例如 singLEFT），必须与游戏请求的名称一致。
desc_anim_symbol => The sprite tag/prefix inside the sprite sheet for this animation (e.g. BF NOTE LEFT0), or the symbol name for Animate atlases. / 精灵表中该动画的标签/前缀（例如 BF NOTE LEFT0），Animate 图集则填符号名。
desc_anim_fps => Playback speed of the animation in frames per second. / 动画的播放速度（帧/秒）。
desc_anim_loop => Whether the animation loops forever or plays once and stays on the last frame. / 动画是无限循环，还是播放一次后停在最后一帧。
desc_anim_indices => ADVANCED: comma-separated list of specific frames to use for this animation. Leave empty to use the whole symbol. / 高级：逗号分隔的帧序号列表，指定该动画使用的具体帧。留空则使用整个符号。
desc_anim_add_update => Add a new animation with the values above, or update the existing one with the same name. Offsets are kept on update. / 用上方数值添加新动画；若名称相同则更新现有动画。更新时保留偏移。
desc_anim_remove => Delete the animation whose name is currently in the Animation Name field. / 删除"动画名称"字段中当前名称对应的动画。
desc_playable => Whether this character is controlled by the player (BF side) or the opponent (Dad side). Toggles flip and position presets. / 该角色由玩家（BF 侧）还是对手（Dad 侧）控制。会切换翻转与默认站位。
desc_flip_x => Mirrors the character sprite horizontally. Stored as flip_x in the JSON. / 水平镜像角色精灵。在 JSON 中保存为 flip_x。
desc_no_aa => Disable antialiasing for this character (pixel-art style). Stored as no_antialiasing. / 为该角色关闭抗锯齿（像素风）。在 JSON 中保存为 no_antialiasing。
desc_scale => Global scale multiplier applied to the character sprite. / 应用于角色精灵的全局缩放倍率。
desc_sing_duration => How long (in beats) the character keeps the singing pose after a note before returning to idle. / 角色在音符后保持唱歌姿态多久（拍），然后回到 idle。
desc_healthbar_colors => Health bar color, saved as healthbar_colors in the character JSON (each 0-255). R = red component, G = green component, B = blue component. Controls the color of the health bar and the health icon - or use "Get Icon Color" in the Character menu to sample it from the icon automatically. / 血条颜色（角色 JSON 中的 healthbar_colors，各分量 0-255）：R = 红色分量，G = 绿色分量，B = 蓝色分量。决定血条与血条图标的颜色，也可在【角色】菜单用"获取图标颜色"从图标自动提取。
desc_pos_x => Stage position X offset added on top of the default opponent/player spot. / 在默认对手/玩家站位基础上叠加的舞台位置 X 偏移。
desc_pos_y => Stage position Y offset added on top of the default opponent/player spot. / 在默认对手/玩家站位基础上叠加的舞台位置 Y 偏移。
desc_cam_x => Camera follow X position relative to the character. / 相机跟随点相对角色的 X 位置。
desc_cam_y => Camera follow Y position relative to the character. / 相机跟随点相对角色的 Y 位置。
desc_make_ghost => Freeze a copy of the current animation frame as a ghost overlay, so you can compare poses while editing offsets. / 将当前动画帧冻结为半透明 Ghost 叠加层，方便编辑偏移时对比姿态。
desc_highlight_ghost => Add a red tint offset to the ghost so it stands out from the real character. / 给 Ghost 叠加层添加红色偏移色调，使其与真实角色区分开。
desc_ghost_alpha => Opacity of the ghost overlay (0 = invisible, 1 = fully opaque). / Ghost 叠加层的不透明度（0 = 完全透明，1 = 完全不透明）。
desc_save => Write the current character data to a JSON file (opens the system save dialog). / 将当前角色数据写入 JSON 文件（弹出系统保存对话框）。
desc_load_template => Replace everything with the default BF template (idle + 4 sing animations) to start over. / 用默认 BF 模板（idle + 4 个唱歌动画）替换全部内容，重新开始。
desc_reload_char => Reload the current character from its JSON file, discarding unsaved changes. / 从 JSON 文件重新加载当前角色，丢弃未保存的修改。
desc_help_camera => Camera controls. / 相机控制。
desc_help_cam_zoom => Zoom the camera in/out. / 相机放大/缩小。
desc_help_cam_move => Pan the camera around the stage. / 在舞台上平移相机。
desc_help_cam_reset => Reset camera zoom back to 1x. / 将相机缩放重置为 1 倍。
desc_help_char => Character controls. / 角色控制。
desc_help_char_anim => Switch between animations. / 切换动画。
desc_help_char_offset => Nudge the current animation's offset. / 微调当前动画的偏移。
desc_help_char_offset_keys => Ctrl+C copy, Ctrl+V paste, Ctrl+R reset, Ctrl+Z undo, Ctrl+Y redo the current offset; Ctrl+S saves the character. / Ctrl+C 复制、Ctrl+V 粘贴、Ctrl+R 重置、Ctrl+Z 撤销、Ctrl+Y 重做当前偏移；Ctrl+S 保存角色。
desc_help_char_replay => Replay the current animation from frame 0. / 从第 0 帧重播当前动画。
desc_help_char_frame => Step through animation frames. / 逐帧步进动画。
desc_help_other => Other controls. / 其他控制。
desc_help_other_sil => Show/hide the stage silhouettes. / 显示/隐藏舞台剪影。
desc_help_other_shift => Speed up offset and camera movement. / 加速偏移与相机移动。
desc_help_other_ctrl => Slow down camera movement. / 降低相机移动速度。
desc_help_other_help => Toggle this help screen. / 切换帮助屏幕。
desc_help_other_exit => Leave the character editor. / 退出角色编辑器。
